{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112249016528539648"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112249040251637894"], "id": "2112249040251637894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 470, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097407140016128", "3_2112097407140057088", "3_2112097407182000128", "3_2112097407169437696"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097414836531229"], "id": "2112097414836531229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 NISHAAN makes headlines!\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition finds a place across the press. Grateful to the journalists sharing our story of faith, art and heritage. \ud83d\ude4f\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark https://t.co/R3X70tWnZs", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097414836531229"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097205490528256", "3_2112097205490495488", "3_2112097205448495104", "3_2112097205448499200"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097213392580776"], "id": "2112097213392580776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 A mark of faith. A story making headlines.\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition and \u201cNISHAAN \u2014 The Mark\u201d finds a place across the press. \ud83d\ude4f\u2728\n\nThank you to the publications\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja20d https://t.co/bzz28fW05M", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097213392580776"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111887009405075456", "3_2111887024684933120", "3_2111887044637270016", "3_2111887070134505472"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:28:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111887088958513154"], "id": "2111887088958513154", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 608, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#88 Visited Ekdalia. Beautiful pandal and pratima as always. Look at the posture of pratima. That is what sets it apart from the rest. Face, eyes aren't the only things. Look at how mother and rest are sitting. Absolutely stunning. Greatest of South Kolkata for a reason. https://t.co/cfJE7N9sHP", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111887088958513154"}, {"author_id": "1304835685610737665", "created_at": "2026-10-18T14:56:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111833790557605926"], "id": "2111833790557605926", "in_reply_to_user_id": "174285951", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 443, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111825968365273478", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mayukhrghosh People love pujo crowd?? Seriously?? I want to know who those people are!!\n2019 was when I went pandal hopping in Kolkata on Shoptomi. I swore not to do that ever again! Escaped a stampede like situation in ekdalia! Joto rajjer chapri, Bihari crowd rastay!", "url": "https://x.com/Tinniz1/status/2111833790557605926"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111679989943087104", "3_2111680000927956992"]}, "author_id": "420943020", "created_at": "2026-10-18T04:45:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111680018418147478"], "id": "2111680018418147478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 188, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Major Durga Puja Pandals have been temporarily closed for Public Entry till the Crowd Management and Security Assessment in On after the Chorebagan Stampede Incident that took place last night due to continuos rain and excessive volatile crowd.\n\n\ud83d\uded1 Tala Pratoy\n\ud83d\uded1 Chetla Agrani https://t.co/kIAWePUkrZ", "url": "https://x.com/kumar3798/status/2111680018418147478"}, {"author_id": "803197771389861888", "created_at": "2026-10-17T18:05:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111518921622999095"], "id": "2111518921622999095", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4718, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "I\u2019m a big-time pandal hopper. Durga Puja evenings are something I look forward to every year. \u2764\ufe0f\n\nToday, I got ready and stepped out to visit Ahiritola, Kumartuli, Chorbagan, Chaltabagan and other nearby pandals.\n\nAfter visiting just two pujas, it started raining. I took a cab", "url": "https://x.com/financialsarthi/status/2111518921622999095"}, {"author_id": "1170441364468830211", "created_at": "2026-10-17T16:42:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111497482039406848", "2111498040070561994", "2111501783784947797"], "id": "2111498040070561994", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 108, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "17 lives lost , still counting and  several injured in a stampede at a Durga Puja pandal  at CHALTABAGAN SARBOJANIN DURGA PUJA in Kolkata. A horrifying testament to the government\u2019s abject failure in crowd management, public safety and administrative accountability.\n\nNever in", "url": "https://x.com/Anika_Breaths/status/2111498040070561994"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111449275335139328"]}, "author_id": "141584822", "created_at": "2026-10-17T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111449653782925485"], "id": "2111449653782925485", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1106, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kolkata, West Bengal: Large numbers of devotees visited Durga Puja pandals across Kolkata on Saptami to offer prayers to Goddess Durga. At Ekdalia Evergreen, the pandal was designed in the style of Gujarat\u2019s iconic Somnath Temple, featuring depictions of Lord Shiva in different https://t.co/5ZwGBcm2lm", "url": "https://x.com/ians_india/status/2111449653782925485"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111348739982163968", "3_2111348756201533440", "3_2111348770889965568"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-17T06:49:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111348784970231892"], "id": "2111348784970231892", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 254, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#69 Visited Kalighat Sanghasree. One of the most prestigious and heritage pujos of South Kolkata. They pioneered and popularized \"scenary pujo\" back in 90s/00s. The pandal and pratima is beautiful. Highly recommend visiting. https://t.co/oa9tcs4zQR", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111348784970231892"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111084695241064449"]}, "author_id": "1028019548", "created_at": "2026-10-16T13:19:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111084724366290991"], "id": "2111084724366290991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 36, "impression_count": 5185, "like_count": 417, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 110}, "text": "When the rain meets the divine, it\u2019s pure magic. \ud83d\udd25\u2764\ufe0f\n\nHindus in New Bengal are celebrating Maa Durga with full enthusiasm, and even the downpour can\u2019t stop the pandal-hopping at Kolkata\u2019s iconic Bagbazar Sarbojanin\u2026 \n\nNothing can dampen Bengal\u2019s Durga Puja spirit! \ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\udea9 https://t.co/3ABfnAcYZD", "url": "https://x.com/Sumita327/status/2111084724366290991"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111048433377378304"]}, "author_id": "3052237998", "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:56:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111048591322275956"], "id": "2111048591322275956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 408, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "If you're pandal-hopping in Kolkata, how can you miss Bagbazar Durga Puja! A celebration of tradition, heritage and history, Bagbazar is a must-visit during Durga Puja. https://t.co/Txm2JF9q5H", "url": "https://x.com/abirghoshal/status/2111048591322275956"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111041880532365312"]}, "author_id": "85990997", "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:29:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111041893362708811"], "id": "2111041893362708811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 934, "like_count": 94, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Queen\u2019s darshan done! \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffc\ud83e\udd79\ud83d\ude07\n\n\ud83d\udccdBaghbazar Sarbojanin \n\n#QueenOfKolkata #Kolkata #DurgaPujo #DurgaPuja https://t.co/FmRexXEBwQ", "url": "https://x.com/PantryCar/status/2111041893362708811"}, {"author_id": "1173065271617081344", "created_at": "2026-10-16T08:41:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111014589932699998"], "id": "2111014589932699998", "in_reply_to_user_id": "85990997", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110995376232866192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PantryCar If you want to do pandal hopping, go to garia, ekdalia side - basically, South Kolkata. North side means, maniktala side, college street etc., don't remember exact spots. Forgot", "url": "https://x.com/RaviVenkatrama5/status/2111014589932699998"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111008022160113664"]}, "author_id": "745524354411159552", "created_at": "2026-10-16T08:18:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111008791777148974"], "id": "2111008791777148974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 456, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Glimpses from the inauguration of Manicktala Chaltabagan Durga Puja by the Hon\u2019ble Governor of West Bengal, Shri R. N. Ravi.\n @chaltabagan @lokbhavan_wb  @shishirkb @me_locket  @HariMohanBangur @RituparnaSpeaks #TapasRoy https://t.co/fUXid3ytU5", "url": "https://x.com/sundeepbhutoria/status/2111008791777148974"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111004399330115584", "3_2111004475196649472", "3_2111004603886276608", "3_2111004661151154176"]}, "author_id": "1291675531939700736", "created_at": "2026-10-16T08:14:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111007857827320179"], "id": "2111007857827320179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 141, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Shri Biswanath Bhansali, DD (MP &amp; SI), NJB visited eco-friendly Durga Puja Pandals (Belgachia Kendriya Sarbojanin Durgotsav &amp; Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatti) made of jute ropes, yarn, fabrics (Kachch Art) &amp; jute fabrics respectively on 16.10.26 to review the extent of jute use. https://t.co/WUJ1jVSiuA", "url": "https://x.com/JuteBoard/status/2111007857827320179"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110946915026358272", "3_2110946915219333120", "3_2110947283881848832", "3_2110947283856756736"]}, "author_id": "1570489236444545027", "created_at": "2026-10-16T04:14:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110947580477874236"], "id": "2110947580477874236", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1279, "like_count": 80, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Governor Ravi and Smt. Laxmi Ravi had Darshan of Maa Durga and offered Puja, praying for the happiness, good health and prosperity of all and for Her blessings as we work together to build a new, resurgent Bengal and reclaim its historic glory.\nThey joined the Durga Puja https://t.co/hDKH2g5wHR", "url": "https://x.com/lokbhavan_wb/status/2110947580477874236"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110837292822822912", "3_2110837324754092032"]}, "author_id": "1486306992490946567", "created_at": "2026-10-15T20:56:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110837364709118261"], "id": "2110837364709118261", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Like every year, visited the Bagbazaar Sarbojonin Durga Pujo. \nNetaji Subhas Chandra Bose served as the President of the Bagbazar Sarbojanin Durgotsav committee from 1938 to 1939.\nSaw this amazing garlanded statue of Netaji there at the entry. \ud83d\ude4f\n\n#DurgaPuja #Kolkata https://t.co/IxxKlgnTTb", "url": "https://x.com/ArijitM28107122/status/2110837364709118261"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110759231448293376", "3_2110759247474839552", "3_2110759260506521600", "3_2110759277086609409"]}, "author_id": "980707444161523712", "created_at": "2026-10-15T15:46:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110759297139503405"], "id": "2110759297139503405", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 199, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "\u09aa\u099e\u09cd\u099a\u09ae\u09c0\u09b0 \u09b6\u09c1\u09ad \u09b8\u09a8\u09cd\u09a7\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u09af\u09bc \u09b0\u09be\u09a3\u09c0\u09b0\u09ac\u09be\u099c\u09be\u09b0 \u09b8\u0982\u0998\u09b6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 \u09b8\u0982